Intrinsics: https://reviews.llvm.org/D119284

Co-authored-by: Mikhail Lychkov <mikhail.lychkov@intel.com>
(cherry picked from commit bc94b7c3a637446748072a9e7fd883724bd6b4e5)
---
 include/LLVMSPIRVExtensions.inc               |  1 +
 lib/SPIRV/libSPIRV/SPIRVInstruction.h         | 44 ++++++++++++
 lib/SPIRV/libSPIRV/SPIRVNameMapEnum.h         |  1 +
 lib/SPIRV/libSPIRV/SPIRVOpCodeEnumInternal.h  |  2 +
 lib/SPIRV/libSPIRV/spirv_internal.hpp         |  9 ++-
 .../complex-operations.ll                     | 67 +++++++++++++++++++
